    "description": "Select a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in. Once per encounter, you can perform any application of that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> as one action quicker than normal, but as at least a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> (for example, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a> becomes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a> becomes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, and a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> becomes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>). Tasks requiring more than one round cannot be optimized with this Talent.",
